    "detailed_description": "Linksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side effects</h2>The core mechanic are the <strong>&quot;Side Effects&quot;</strong> you attach to the sides of your character.<br>These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels.<br>By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Head-scratching puzzles</h2>Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse levels</h2>The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Award-winning</h2>Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.",
    "about_the_game": "Linksider is a puzzle game with simple yet challenging mechanics.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/1f11d38995e881b4f8f5a4108288bfa2.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Side effects</h2>The core mechanic are the <strong>&quot;Side Effects&quot;</strong> you attach to the sides of your character.<br>These effects interact with the environment in different ways, changing how the player navigates the levels.<br>By combining multiple effects in different ways you may find surprising solutions to the puzzles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/08526bede87c7d982280c84b21faa68d.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Head-scratching puzzles</h2>Reaching the goal in some levels can be quite tricky. Sometimes you need to go back in order to stop being stuck in a loop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/53425fcbf6b248af1ba08340808081b4.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse levels</h2>The game has around 100 levels exploring the different mechanics, from jumping and sliding, to portals and manipulating gravity.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.poster.avif?t=1744362565\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.webm?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995150/extras/f004ae383d5c8b3dee13bde9420171c7.mp4?t=1744362565\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Award-winning</h2>Linksider was originally made for and won the Bevy Game Jam #3.",
